<title>USA: Oil-Dri authorizes share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Oil-Dri authorizes share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil-Dri Corp of America on Monday said its board of directors authorized the repurchase of 400,000 shares of Oil-Dri common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it would buy the shares from time to time, subject to market conditions.</p>
<p>Oil-Dri said the company bought back 309,000 shares under a previous program authorized in June 1996, and a total of 609,000 since June 1991.</p>
<p>Oil-Dri provides sorbent products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
